window.DIGEST.foryou.push(...[{"id": "2112719581072556540", "url": "https://x.com/0xSolty/status/2112719581072556540", "text": "your 5-hour limit doesn't die while you work. it dies when you come back from a break and type <continue> one variable fixes most of it:\n\nexport CLAUDE_CODE_IDLE_COMPACT_MIN_TOKENS=100000\n\nthe prompt cache lives about an hour. leave a long session longer than that, and your next message re-reads the whole thing at full price.\n\nsince this month Claude Code fights back:\n\n→ at ~54 min idle it compacts the session, right before the cache expires\n→ by default only for sessions over 200K tokens\n→ the variable drops that to 100K, so mid-size sessions get saved too\n\ncheck it's on: /config → Idle compaction\n\nthe variable is one piece. the full setup has 3 more:\n\n→ the resume warning, shipped yesterday. resume an old chat and Claude Code tells you when it will eat a big part of your 5-hour limit. pick \"start new\" and just mention the old chat. Claude looks it up instead of reloading all of it\n→ CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW=200000. write the full number. \"200k\" was silently turning into a 100K window until this week's fix\n→ /usage at the end of a long day. it now flags max effort, workflows, always-on context and huge tool results, the usual limit killers\n\nthe full tree\n> long session goes idle\n> ~54 min: idle compaction, before the cache expires\n> sessions from 100K included with the variable\n> resume warning before an expensive reload\n> /usage shows what actually ate the limit\n\npaste this into Claude Code ↓\n\n\"Audit my Claude Code setup for usage-limit leaks:\n1. Add CLAUDE_CODE_IDLE_COMPACT_MIN_TOKENS=100000 to my shell profile.\n2. Check /config and make sure Idle compaction is on.\n3. If CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW is set anywhere, rewrite it as a full number (200000, not 200k).\n4. Add one line to CLAUDE.md: when I come back to an old task after a break, start a new session and reference the old one instead of resuming it.\nShow every change as a diff first. Don't apply anything until I say go.\"\n\n↳ http://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\n\nthe model isn't what's eating your limit. the coffee break is.", "name": "Solty", "handle": "0xSolty", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2105368881640390656/MQKCHyaj_200x200.jpg", "likes": 12, "rts": 2, "replies": 3, "views": 737, "ts": 1792546575, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112719259730096129/vid/avc1/720x900/eCqI49T1PRCxFb9i.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112719259730096129/vid/avc1/1080x1350/kp2MNZNx1a27fs8Q.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112719259730096129/img/uUj8oF0iyxSX5Wl3.jpg", "dur": 40}], "quote": {"id": "2078784709253841039", "url": "https://x.com/Bober_smart/status/2078784709253841039", "text": "", "name": "Bober_smart", "handle": "Bober_smart", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2050347090543300608/p1PlS_hc_200x200.jpg", "likes": 2860, "rts": 386, "replies": 98, "views": 12338202, "ts": 1784455871, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.99, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112684911475994937", "url": "https://x.com/NICKIMINAJ/status/2112684911475994937", "text": "😅", "name": "Nicki Minaj", "handle": "NICKIMINAJ", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2044505524234797056/kKiF5v8h_200x200.jpg", "likes": 3083, "rts": 401, "replies": 89, "views": 131429, "ts": 1792538309, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112680862332375539", "url": "https://x.com/priscy776/status/2112680862332375539", "text": "Not her asking if cowgirls work with him 😭😭😂😂😂... she's so funny 🤣 #MillionDollarPitch", "name": "Priscy 𓏲ּ𝄢⋆", "handle": "priscy776", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2030592646301782016/-0k0IlYI_200x200.jpg", "likes": 819, "rts": 59, "replies": 10, "views": 96888, "ts": 1792537343, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112680204799819776/vid/avc1/630x360/pASIMLgNmuATHZCM.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112680204799819776/vid/avc1/1080x616/pS6LiFvxgoguqokC.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112680204799819776/img/AWRNn4UoH1pewnFw.jpg", "dur": 37}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 4.99, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112547306616619426", "url": "https://x.com/ryouxbt/status/2112547306616619426", "text": "This is f*king insane. Anthropic engineer:\n\n\"At Anthropic, we do more than write prompts\n\nWe build harnesses\"\n\nIn 42 minutes, she shows how the Claude team uses a harness to manage context, loops, and agent workflows\n\nPrompts → Agents → Harness → Loops → Self-Improving Systems\n\nIf this were a $500 course, people would call it one of the best agent courses of the year\n\nIt's free\n\nWatch it, then follow the step-by-step guide below to build your first harness", "name": "ryou", "handle": "ryouxbt", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106059788241002496/gUK9pyUF_200x200.jpg", "likes": 30, "rts": 2, "replies": 3, "views": 832, "ts": 1792505501, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112535151922044929/vid/avc1/1282x720/21O0-B8-8ROVs1vZ.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112535151922044929/vid/avc1/1924x1080/SuSHbhtttOetOk8Y.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112535151922044929/img/3TW3nQBjb8f1jW3d.jpg", "dur": 1836}], "quote": {"id": "2093685107534000560", "url": "https://x.com/0xwhrrari/status/2093685107534000560", "text": "https://x.com/i/article/2093441687989186560", "name": "rari", "handle": "0xwhrrari", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029005608125431808/RHmOjHaB_200x200.jpg", "likes": 1791, "rts": 301, "replies": 74, "views": 4947964, "ts": 1788008403, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.99, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112728813503189323", "url": "https://x.com/OdinCT_/status/2112728813503189323", "text": "founders will automate the entire business before figuring out how to market the product 💀 @avastudio_", "name": "OdinCT | Clipur.ai", "handle": "OdinCT_", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089792687490637824/pTjbQ9YK_200x200.jpg", "likes": 21, "rts": 0, "replies": 1, "views": 819, "ts": 1792548776, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112606581229769030", "url": "https://x.com/avastudio_/status/2112606581229769030", "text": "We just turned TikToks and Reels into a Claude Code task.\n\nMeet Ava Studio, for founders whose product is live but nobody knows it exists.\n\nGive your agent your product URL and let it research trends across 400,000+ TikToks, write scripts and create videos ready to post.", "name": "Ava Studio", "handle": "avastudio_", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2060828052645384197/o5Z3NzuU_200x200.jpg", "likes": 381, "rts": 75, "replies": 88, "views": 202673, "ts": 1792519633, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112606467731943424/vid/avc1/1280x720/wBPNy4C8XvnT1Mr4.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112606467731943424/vid/avc1/1920x1080/0kVGCjlWFJaXfCpq.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112606467731943424/img/UhUfy5CUaqFygliU.jpg", "dur": 39}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.99, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112575730521645225", "url": "https://x.com/HYPEX/status/2112575730521645225", "text": "FNAF x ROCKET LEAGUE TEASER\n\nSome of these cosmetics likely transform to Fortnite", "name": "HYPEX", "handle": "HYPEX", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1680830035639369730/0BG8cBZa_200x200.jpg", "likes": 5186, "rts": 265, "replies": 46, "views": 276971, "ts": 1792512278, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112575603052322816/vid/avc1/1280x720/ZoMFWWsEGt-uUudN.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112575603052322816/vid/avc1/1920x1080/FR-5i1i23J5C2KS7.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112575603052322816/img/YUeUJTQ9CeWsjwLg.jpg", "dur": 9}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Sports", "score": 4.98, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112618909040091445", "url": "https://x.com/CopyRebeldia/status/2112618909040091445", "text": "La industria farmacéutica abandonó a las víctimas de escorpión porque no eran negocio.\nClaude no necesitaba que fueran negocio.\n\nEn 64 horas, casi solo, diseñó 318.484 proteínas que no existían para bloquear sus neurotoxinas. Dos laboratorios probaron 211 diseños y 17 se agarraron a la toxina.\n\nLas dos mejores van contra un alacrán mexicano.\n\nEl antídoto de siempre todavía sale de la sangre de caballos. El próximo podría salir de una IA.", "name": "CopyRebeldia", "handle": "CopyRebeldia", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2034089342205833216/_D4TRnCt_200x200.jpg", "likes": 21, "rts": 4, "replies": 0, "views": 2815, "ts": 1792522573, "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGHs0za8AABEjD.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": {"id": "2112579251555721573", "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2112579251555721573", "text": "New on our Science Blog: designing protein binders against scorpion neurotoxins.\n\nScorpions sting about 1.2m people every year, and antivenoms are often costly or in short supply. Claude has made an early step toward finding new treatments.\n\nhttps://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-scorpion-toxin-binder-design", "name": "Anthropic", "handle": "AnthropicAI", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1798110641414443008/XP8gyBaY_200x200.jpg", "likes": 5775, "rts": 455, "replies": 393, "views": 1191640, "ts": 1792513118, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.98, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112617742427623707", "url": "https://x.com/Y0urDumble/status/2112617742427623707", "text": "THIS IS A PURE F*CKING GOLDMINE\n\n6 Grok bots launched 5 AI influencers, grew them to 16,286 followers and put 3 tokens live on their stories. no human touched a single post\n\ndead internet theory isn’t a theory anymore. it’s a pipeline\n\nUncle Gus, Otis, Lars, Dexter, Rocco. none of them exist. the bots cast them, film them, post them and answer their comments\n\nand the second a character crosses 2,500 followers, it gets its own token built on its own narrative\n\n$GUS went live first. then $OTIS. then $LARS. Dexter is 171 followers away from his\n\nday 12 right now:\n\n16,286 followers\n45 videos\n391 replies\n$1,386 in creator fees, split across 10 wallets\n\nthe idea: one strong model writes the plan, a line of cheap bots runs it 24/7\n\nhere’s the line:\n\n→ SCOUT finds a trend nobody owns yet\n→ CASTER turns it into a persona with a fixed look, voice and 12 traits\n→ DIRECTOR renders one 8s video a day\n→ POSTER ships it with the AI label on\n→ FARMER replies in the persona’s voice\n→ LAUNCHER waits for 2,500 followers, then opens a token on that character’s story\n\nthe planner only shows up three times:\n\n→ writing farm.md before day 1\n→ reading the numbers at night\n→ signing off before any token goes live\n\nit plans. Grok runs. the gate decides.\n\ncost per video: $0.38. a freelance editor charges $45\n\nthat’s why your feed is filling up with people who were cast by a bot last week\n\nthe full line\n\nplanner writes farm.md and one file per persona\nscout ranks trends nobody owns\ncaster locks each persona: face, voice, 12 traits\ndirector renders 8s 9:16, same face every day\nposter ships with the AI label, farmer replies as the character\nlauncher holds every token behind a 2,500 follower gate\n\npaste the prompt below into Grok ↓\n\nsave it, it’ll come in handy.", "name": "Dumble", "handle": "Y0urDumble", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103962793485475840/yB2v8EZQ_200x200.jpg", "likes": 15, "rts": 2, "replies": 6, "views": 580, "ts": 1792522294, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112617402739359744/vid/avc1/720x900/fpfIRt9UqenNfmLP.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112617402739359744/vid/avc1/1080x1350/gTF4yj9Nhc4marX6.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112617402739359744/img/Ov_I-uV50bvju8-D.jpg", "dur": 20}], "quote": {"id": "2109342020921659784", "url": "https://x.com/Y0urDumble/status/2109342020921659784", "text": "10 videos. 276,000 followers. $12,000,000 coin.\n\nthe guy isn't real.\n\nhere's how to make one yourself for $15, even if you've never edited a video https://x.com/i/article/2109318233866006528", "name": "Dumble", "handle": "Y0urDumble", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103962793485475840/yB2v8EZQ_200x200.jpg", "likes": 125, "rts": 8, "replies": 10, "views": 897201, "ts": 1791741302, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.98, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112618311045231043", "url": "https://x.com/omnigent_ai/status/2112618311045231043", "text": "Omnigent v0.19.0 is now available! 🎉\n\n🔌 MCP registry and gateway: connect managed accounts in Settings, pick tools for local hosts or sandboxes through a server gateway with shared policy checks\n🔐 Sandboxed agents use approved Git repos over SSH without receiving the key\n🎚️ Set reasoning effort for Claude SDK and Codex SDK agents from the web composer\n\nRelease notes: https://omnigent.ai/releases/0.19.0\n\n#Omnigent #OpenSource", "name": "Omnigent", "handle": "omnigent_ai", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077430840078819328/vMYcQMg__200x200.jpg", "likes": 17, "rts": 4, "replies": 2, "views": 1299, "ts": 1792522430, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.98, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112514315714744830", "url": "https://x.com/sidhant/status/2112514315714744830", "text": "No joint press conference in Mumbai after US Secy of state Rubio & EAM Jaishankar meet in Mumbai, like the one happened in Delhi this year. \n\nLooks like American side was vary of taking question from Indian side on recent instances of racism, anti India rehtoric in US.", "name": "Sidhant Sibal", "handle": "sidhant", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1314827245010132992/jfPBU-7k_200x200.jpg", "likes": 5185, "rts": 682, "replies": 59, "views": 158375, "ts": 1792497636, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2058461912028131581", "url": "https://x.com/sidhant/status/2058461912028131581", "text": "\"Who said that...\", US Secretary of State Rubio in response to my question on racism agaisnt Indians in US. \n\nUS President Donald Trump had endorsed a post terming India \"Hellhole\"", "name": "Sidhant Sibal", "handle": "sidhant", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1314827245010132992/jfPBU-7k_200x200.jpg", "likes": 20522, "rts": 3384, "replies": 847, "views": 1713911, "ts": 1779610538, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2058461836635426816/pu/vid/avc1/680x360/Z7h2QYVgysaZCOnX.mp4?tag=25", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2058461836635426816/pu/vid/avc1/1088x576/RQZ1x-xIcBVOcsGj.mp4?tag=25", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2058461836635426816/pu/img/Waj4PPWanX2ktebb.jpg", "dur": 121}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Politics & World", "score": 4.98, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112606360290636207", "url": "https://x.com/yukonresearch/status/2112606360290636207", "text": "One cell becomes an entire animal, and nobody can predict how  🧬\n\nNEW CHALLENGE: http://yukon.org/virtualembryo\n\nVirtual Embryo on Yukon: predict which cells become muscle, which become nerve, and when. A million cells across eleven time points.\n\nSubmit the working model, not the predictions. Everything runs through the official evaluator.", "name": "Yukon", "handle": "yukonresearch", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2085474058481901569/3ja-X-Np_200x200.jpg", "likes": 13, "rts": 6, "replies": 1, "views": 1804, "ts": 1792519581, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112605731463794916", "url": "https://x.com/sreeramkannan/status/2112605731463794916", "text": "🧬 Virtual Embryo x Yukon 🧬\n\nOpen Collaborative Model Building\n\nhttps://yukon.org/virtualembryo\n\nYukon connects the world's leading scientists with a community of researchers and agents to solve the most ambitious problems of humanity.\n\nToday we're taking on our first biology problem:", "name": "Sreeram Kannan", "handle": "sreeramkannan", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1957594394892312577/dsAJIX9F_200x200.jpg", "likes": 56, "rts": 16, "replies": 7, "views": 9412, "ts": 1792519431, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112603938008809473/vid/avc1/1280x720/9SFXn0V26OuppMn6.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112603938008809473/vid/avc1/3840x2160/61H3qnxr0SGyR3T6.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112603938008809473/img/flqG717dnLr9JQw5.jpg", "dur": 44}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.97, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112608089916780800", "url": "https://x.com/PipeAbellos/status/2112608089916780800", "text": "we decided to change our name\n\n@paulg once said 'If you have a US startup called X and you don't have (x).com, you should probably change your name (...) The problem with not having the .com of your name is that it signals weakness. Unless you're so big that your reputation precedes you, a marginal domain suggests you're a marginal company. '\n\nso from now on, you can find us on agentcard(dot)com\n\nthanks to @dharmesh  for making this possible!\n\nand as always, here's a video we're very proud of :)", "name": "IT guy", "handle": "PipeAbellos", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2083240057964478464/AS8ZLNOm_200x200.jpg", "likes": 25, "rts": 0, "replies": 4, "views": 2203, "ts": 1792519993, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112607176443428864/vid/avc1/1280x720/D7gW2ewPmJNLRQJQ.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112607176443428864/vid/avc1/1920x1080/eZUkVD8V3HMSSg_p.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112607176443428864/img/geMBjvnAGF6JxFR8.jpg", "dur": 91}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Video, Art & Music", "score": 4.97, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112592179160101277", "url": "https://x.com/Rainmaker1973/status/2112592179160101277", "text": "The boss secretly joins his own company as a new junior worker, and when he sees his real boss panicking like crazy to avoid a fine for being only two minutes late, he is shocked beyond words", "name": "Massimo", "handle": "Rainmaker1973", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/914888589670043654/KVvwjcWA_200x200.jpg", "likes": 4809, "rts": 235, "replies": 53, "views": 562484, "ts": 1792516200, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112215585878638592/vid/avc1/422x360/HDsTPG70uGaBRJNz.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112215585878638592/vid/avc1/648x552/LhI1jBX6zSqY8kLJ.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112215585878638592/img/3U51QLDbD1Bays3G.jpg", "dur": 57}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 4.97, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112704572900950298", "url": "https://x.com/theprojecttv/status/2112704572900950298", "text": "A teacher in Spain has won hearts online after footage showed him singing with his students while they practised sign language together. \n\nJuan Gonzalez Caballero has spent nearly 20 years using music in the classroom and was recently nominated for a national award recognising Spain’s best primary school teachers.", "name": "The Project", "handle": "theprojecttv", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1747088180174860288/i75DokOv_200x200.jpg", "likes": 12, "rts": 4, "replies": 0, "views": 1975, "ts": 1792542996, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112704108163649536/vid/avc1/720x1280/iHMLLaHNCAC1-4E0.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112704108163649536/vid/avc1/1080x1920/5SSUqXtWndhMH1TP.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112704108163649536/img/1KyRvkfecA6VzkHb.jpg", "dur": 50}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Video, Art & Music", "score": 4.97, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112702641038119240", "url": "https://x.com/ivanburazin/status/2112702641038119240", "text": "thanks for having me @sophiadew!", "name": "Ivan Burazin", "handle": "ivanburazin", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1549052013178134529/FljtGcgj_200x200.jpg", "likes": 22, "rts": 0, "replies": 1, "views": 1237, "ts": 1792542536, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112696948402843722", "url": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2112696948402843722", "text": "Daytona CEO @ivanburazin explains why AI agents need computers that boot in 60 milliseconds and multiply like the Marvel multiverse:\n\n\"A year and a half ago, agents as they are today were not a thing. There were a few people building it, and we would give them our old human infrastructure, and they were like, this sucks.\"\n\n\"Historically, any of the virtual machines you can get on the hyperscalers will spin up in a few minutes, two to three minutes. Ours will spin up in 60 milliseconds. You blink at 120, so it’s like half your blink.\"\n\n\"A human can work on one computer at the same time. An agent can literally, like the Marvel multiverse, branch off the entire world. You have your computer, and you can replicate it into two computers, then four, then six, until you get to your outcome.\"\n@daytonaio", "name": "MTS", "handle": "MTSlive", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2057947669281263616/aovpVL4b_200x200.jpg", "likes": 16, "rts": 0, "replies": 2, "views": 4116, "ts": 1792541179, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112696873081561088/vid/avc1/640x360/WWyfmx4OqAorjHfa.mp4?tag=16", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112696873081561088/vid/avc1/1280x720/Xm2dXsBIfrWKZKGa.mp4?tag=16", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112696873081561088/img/9mCysKN4hTZvPP1O.jpg", "dur": 92}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.97, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112760618612818157", "url": "https://x.com/valkyare/status/2112760618612818157", "text": "most ai video tools leave you staring at an empty prompt box. this one looks at what’s already working on tiktok and gives you a place to start @avastudio_", "name": "valkyare", "handle": "valkyare", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2098516554220765184/p7pbY-j7_200x200.jpg", "likes": 15, "rts": 1, "replies": 1, "views": 346, "ts": 1792556359, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112760590510989312/vid/avc1/588x360/PCEC6GcvN43iJLaM.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112760590510989312/vid/avc1/1178x720/jIJTVyT4xNgIOPVl.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112760590510989312/img/V0Zz4w9nT1lrJSu4.jpg", "dur": 7}], "quote": {"id": "2112606581229769030", "url": "https://x.com/avastudio_/status/2112606581229769030", "text": "We just turned TikToks and Reels into a Claude Code task.\n\nMeet Ava Studio, for founders whose product is live but nobody knows it exists.\n\nGive your agent your product URL and let it research trends across 400,000+ TikToks, write scripts and create videos ready to post.", "name": "Ava Studio", "handle": "avastudio_", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2060828052645384197/o5Z3NzuU_200x200.jpg", "likes": 390, "rts": 76, "replies": 89, "views": 205863, "ts": 1792519633, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112606467731943424/vid/avc1/1280x720/wBPNy4C8XvnT1Mr4.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112606467731943424/vid/avc1/1920x1080/0kVGCjlWFJaXfCpq.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112606467731943424/img/UhUfy5CUaqFygliU.jpg", "dur": 39}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.97, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112607248568730035", "url": "https://x.com/LangChain/status/2112607248568730035", "text": "More Managed Deep Agents resources:  \n\n🎓 LangChain Academy Module: https://academy.langchain.com/courses/foundation-introduction-to-deepagents \n\n💻 Managed Deep Agents 101: https://events.langchain.com/on-demand/f61a1237-3a14-4ff9-9c95-6338fbece13c \n\n⏯️ YouTube Tutorial playlist: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xdrB53bgpp0&list=PLKYx7JmJ_IcA", "name": "LangChain", "handle": "LangChain", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2028336270431453184/jRRpLAdG_200x200.jpg", "likes": 16, "rts": 4, "replies": 2, "views": 4249, "ts": 1792519793, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112589667287617946", "url": "https://x.com/LangChain/status/2112589667287617946", "text": "What is a Managed Deep Agent?\n\nHow does it differ from a Deep Agent?\n\nHow do you get started?\n\n@jess_weng18 from the LangChain Academy team answers all of these questions in 2 minutes", "name": "LangChain", "handle": "LangChain", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2028336270431453184/jRRpLAdG_200x200.jpg", "likes": 29, "rts": 2, "replies": 7, "views": 12135, "ts": 1792515601, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112584588253921280/vid/avc1/1280x720/Yz7Gqdpy0jxNYTBc.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112584588253921280/vid/avc1/1920x1080/zE2E5mjGjis6MApV.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112584588253921280/img/N_Ljvb9gnO389HV0.jpg", "dur": 132}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.96, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112562928302035408", "url": "https://x.com/egor65884/status/2112562928302035408", "text": "my 9 agents ran for 14 hours straight and finally cracked the Postgres formula\n\nturns out it's just a database. the devs have been hiding this since 1996\n\ndropping it here for free, open source, no signup required\n\nhttps://github.com/postgres/postgres", "name": "Astarot", "handle": "egor65884", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2102719149344772096/DuX_vZbv_200x200.jpg", "likes": 21, "rts": 2, "replies": 5, "views": 566, "ts": 1792509226, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112562428986949634/vid/avc1/720x720/pJeD92FtSFRnfE9F.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112562428986949634/vid/avc1/1080x1080/hW_eMydzdwtYduqX.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112562428986949634/img/u3y-GYxv0vKqfbNM.jpg", "dur": 8}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.96, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112549985870856557", "url": "https://x.com/JJEnglert/status/2112549985870856557", "text": "Throwing this in the action button + island is GOATED.\n\nI have this setup for my @Muse, but there is a delay, brings you into the app, and isn't a voice call / chat (which I desperately need)\n\nBIG win for @bot here.", "name": "JJ Englert", "handle": "JJEnglert", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020688928215646208/w1dcfnp3_200x200.jpg", "likes": 27, "rts": 0, "replies": 6, "views": 3702, "ts": 1792506140, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112252507762368684", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2112252507762368684", "text": "Grok Bot is now one step closer.\n\nSet it as your iPhone's Action Button and press it to talk with Bot.", "name": "Grok Bot", "handle": "bot", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2087219239275069440/KW6C403V_200x200.jpg", "likes": 16942, "rts": 1069, "replies": 2244, "views": 2261943, "ts": 1792435216, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112252262500446208/vid/avc1/1280x720/kXShFF-0PEWewt_F.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112252262500446208/vid/avc1/1920x1080/M9VKUr0ZYmdggYB6.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112252262500446208/img/jTcS-yhVQysB-fwO.jpg", "dur": 13}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.96, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112505856684069342", "url": "https://x.com/RetroChainer/status/2112505856684069342", "text": "$30 A MONTH AND I'M NOT A ONE-PERSON OPERATION ANYMORE. FOUR GROK BOTS RUN MY INBOX, RESEARCH AND ADMIN, AND THE ONLY THING THAT COMES BACK TO ME IS ONE LINE: ACTION, TARGET, REASON.\n\none employee: me. now a team.\n\n→ daily chief writes tomorrow's brief: 3 meetings, 2 deadlines, the open questions\n\n→ inbox lead sorts priority mail and drafts the replies\n\n→ research scout brings findings with sources, facts apart from guesses\n\n→ life admin tracks the passport renewal, the insurance papers, the dentist\n\nthe brief runs at 07:30 every weekday. my laptop can stay closed.\n\nhonestly my favourite is life admin. it found 2 dentist slots and wrote \"needs your pick.\" it never books.\n\ni kept the boring job for myself: approve or edit.\n\nthe line that comes back to me is on screen in the clip.", "name": "RetroChainer", "handle": "RetroChainer", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092988169855623169/oA-J_H7f_200x200.jpg", "likes": 33, "rts": 1, "replies": 4, "views": 1189, "ts": 1792495619, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112497763585773568/vid/avc1/720x960/-DQmugcFj1kEHhGA.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112497763585773568/vid/avc1/1440x1920/wNVAulDj-d3uesRQ.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112497763585773568/img/LiggA-BSrLDQnUGk.jpg", "dur": 15}], "quote": {"id": "2109293672495784029", "url": "https://x.com/irongiantXBT/status/2109293672495784029", "text": "https://x.com/i/article/2109287151040888832", "name": "Iron Giant", "handle": "irongiantXBT", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2073301331738046464/UuZ4Un9H_200x200.jpg", "likes": 321, "rts": 47, "replies": 34, "views": 470020, "ts": 1791729774, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.95, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112635820611977250", "url": "https://x.com/multimodalart/status/2112635820611977250", "text": "yay! FastH3 Omni is now open weights! 📹 \n\nhigh quality 8 step reference-to-video, fully end-to-end open source (including training code)\n\nthis is the model many said rivals fal's H3 Max 👀\n\n▶️ on Spaces https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/FastH3-Omni\n\n📁 Model https://huggingface.co/collections/FastVideo/fasth3-omni", "name": "apolinario (poli)", "handle": "multimodalart", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998217136209289216/yL6PoQig_200x200.jpg", "likes": 21, "rts": 0, "replies": 4, "views": 1694, "ts": 1792526605, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112625528805208257", "url": "https://x.com/haoailab/status/2112625528805208257", "text": "As promised, FastVideo open-sources @MiniMax_AI  FastH3 Omni, training code included! 🚀\n\n- Real-time gen @ 12x faster on NVIDIA Blackwell\n- NVFP4/FP8 for Spark + RTX!\n- ComfyUI day-0\n\nCollab with @NVIDIAAI , Nuva Lab @nuvalab and Reactor @reactorworld\n\nOpen source must win! ♥️", "name": "Hao AI Lab", "handle": "haoailab", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1768567902129807360/paum8hpu_200x200.jpg", "likes": 434, "rts": 50, "replies": 26, "views": 36218, "ts": 1792524151, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112619935101054976/vid/avc1/1280x720/tIgsMSq-A3UVe323.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112619935101054976/vid/avc1/1920x1080/s6Xy_scPhdkRvd89.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112619935101054976/img/ErrljJJaTjJHMPbc.jpg", "dur": 28}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.95, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112489978752303131", "url": "https://x.com/TheAiGirl0/status/2112489978752303131", "text": "Putting this on your radar before the offer ends on October 24.\n\nDeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 uses 0.0x Credits in Qoder until then.\n\nhttps://qoder.com/qoder", "name": "The Ai Girl | News & Tools", "handle": "TheAiGirl0", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2044062843872653313/dFChfzLO_200x200.jpg", "likes": 26, "rts": 0, "replies": 10, "views": 8827, "ts": 1792491833, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112211366954344459", "url": "https://x.com/qoder_ai_ide/status/2112211366954344459", "text": "DeepSeek dropped V4.1-Flash-1017 on Saturday. It's been in Qoder since day one.\n\nNow it's FREE through Oct 24. 0.0x credits for free and paid users. Just select it and go.", "name": "Qoder", "handle": "qoder_ai_ide", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2095469609130528768/1SnxjZJP_200x200.jpg", "likes": 715, "rts": 80, "replies": 168, "views": 3455913, "ts": 1792425407, "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVAVBHAa0AArz_n.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.95, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112717183046521085", "url": "https://x.com/parkersmith/status/2112717183046521085", "text": "The speed improvements are so good", "name": "Parker Smith", "handle": "parkersmith", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1646176640010186752/s3snEpA8_200x200.jpg", "likes": 22, "rts": 0, "replies": 0, "views": 1583, "ts": 1792546003, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112550158885917122", "url": "https://x.com/mattyp/status/2112550158885917122", "text": "What's new in Grok Bot\n\n00:00 New chat cards\n00:31 Speed\n00:53 Draft edits\n01:08 Email aliases\n01:33 X DMs\n01:55 Tag @bot\n02:31 Connectors\n02:48 Voice calls \n03:27 Notifications\n03:56 Invites and Android Assistant\n04:19 Access lists, unread, routines, sign-in\n\nThis team ships!", "name": "matt palmer", "handle": "mattyp", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2111918243460030464/aVMpxoAo_200x200.jpg", "likes": 4673, "rts": 348, "replies": 557, "views": 838754, "ts": 1792506181, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112393221154177024/vid/avc1/1280x720/vRjPQmAsuZZDbuFk.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112393221154177024/vid/avc1/3840x2160/A10gDEDKTZGilywJ.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVC8fIWXEAI1tL3.jpg", "dur": 306}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.95, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112528840593387590", "url": "https://x.com/EricBalchunas/status/2112528840593387590", "text": "Trump Accounts may soon be expanded even more to anyone under 40yrs old. That would be another 100 million people, on top of the 70 million kids and 3.5mil babies born each year. This according to Brad Gerstner who is the main guy spearheading efforts on this. He also said Elon is 'tip of iceberg'   Nice scoop and piece on it from @LydiaMoynihan @nypost", "name": "Eric Balchunas", "handle": "EricBalchunas", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007953725831180288/1e2n5kDL_200x200.jpg", "likes": 4786, "rts": 410, "replies": 269, "views": 1154116, "ts": 1792501099, "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVE1AeyXYAAbX1P.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Politics & World", "score": 4.95, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112476416621326763", "url": "https://x.com/LFC/status/2112476416621326763", "text": "Matchday ready 🤝 @TommyHilfiger", "name": "Liverpool FC", "handle": "LFC", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2081665008203612160/Gj9rU9ks_200x200.jpg", "likes": 6402, "rts": 419, "replies": 41, "views": 500622, "ts": 1792488600, "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVAMmayXUAAUlzc.jpg?name=orig"}, {"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVAMn_FXgAAIAqc.jpg?name=orig"}, {"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVAMqFZWQAAIdjn.jpg?name=orig"}, {"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVAMr2XW4AE7fMC.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 4.95, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112557369821409505", "url": "https://x.com/csaba_kissi/status/2112557369821409505", "text": "One of the most frustrating things about AI coding tools is having to explain the same project over and over again 😅\n\nI love the idea of agents actually learning from previous sessions, even when switching between Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex.\n\nAnd it’s open source 👀", "name": "Csaba Kissi", "handle": "csaba_kissi", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1454861068233228289/6sn9BYOf_200x200.jpg", "likes": 18, "rts": 0, "replies": 9, "views": 2264, "ts": 1792507901, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112552451547001218", "url": "https://x.com/jqdsouza/status/2112552451547001218", "text": "We’re betting our $5.5M seed round that the next leap in AI coding won’t come from OpenAI or Anthropic.\n\nIt’ll come from a new feedback loop that learns from you.\n\nIntroducing Beacon: open-source, self-improving memory for coding agents.\n\nYour sessions capture how you debug and solve problems. Today, that context gets lost and you have to re-explain things every time you switch tools.\n\nBeacon continuously distills your sessions into reusable skills across Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and 20+ harnesses, so your next agent can learn from the last.\n\nBeacon is free and OSS 🌟 http://github.com/Asymptote-Labs/agent-beacon\n\nWhy should the frontier labs be the only ones winning with your sessions?\n\nYou already did the work. Now let your coding agents learn from you.", "name": "Justin D'Souza", "handle": "jqdsouza", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1817440734766604288/99FuIxoo_200x200.jpg", "likes": 1279, "rts": 141, "replies": 251, "views": 425937, "ts": 1792506728, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112552129952874496/vid/avc1/1280x720/mhJ2imMl6mA4kQEF.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112552129952874496/vid/avc1/1920x1080/2nvostHi1eUMqE7-.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112552129952874496/img/X1ifILIq6yhlSaGJ.jpg", "dur": 109}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112597212429717569", "url": "https://x.com/niklaslenz_ai/status/2112597212429717569", "text": "32 GB class: Qwen3.8-27B on my RTX 5090 built a steampunk airship dock in 61.6 minutes, thinking on.\n\n@MiaAI_lab's one-click kit: EXL3 4.0 bpw + MTP, with the agent harness it ships. EXL3 quant by @turboderp_.\nOne try, no help.\n\nBrowser check: 7.5/10\nTokens written: 129,606\nSpeed benchmark: 149 tok/s decode (separate run, thinking off)\n\nOn the way it found and fixed its own NaN bug in the voxel code.\n\nVery impressive for a 27B.\n\nExact command and raw files: https://niklaslenz.com/v2/qwen38-27b-exl3-4-0bpw-mtp-5090/", "name": "Niklas", "handle": "niklaslenz_ai", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108625696088113152/uVudOEyp_200x200.jpg", "likes": 15, "rts": 1, "replies": 7, "views": 1800, "ts": 1792517400, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112554434068680704/vid/avc1/1280x720/RzSAGQpXYyfw5s7u.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112554434068680704/vid/avc1/1920x1080/zGyGyV0cbblgKm16.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112554434068680704/img/5AWHpUWnKwjEK8jY.jpg", "dur": 37}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112637394654822514", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112637394654822514", "text": "Our Q3 2026 earnings report is now public → https://ir.spacex.com/files/content_files/SpaceX-Reports-Third-Quarter-2026-Results.pdf\n\nThe live webcast with @ElonMusk, @Gwynne_Shotwell, and @BretWJ will begin in 30 minutes", "name": "SpaceX", "handle": "SpaceX", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1697749409851985920/HbrI04tM_200x200.jpg", "likes": 3135, "rts": 394, "replies": 156, "views": 392743, "ts": 1792526980, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112559638579499258", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112559638579499258", "text": "Watch live as SpaceX discusses our Q3 2026 earnings at 3:30pm CT today → https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1PKqrNbLZbPGb", "name": "SpaceX", "handle": "SpaceX", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1697749409851985920/HbrI04tM_200x200.jpg", "likes": 5932, "rts": 847, "replies": 491, "views": 2114154, "ts": 1792508441, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112616915617136830", "url": "https://x.com/zapier/status/2112616915617136830", "text": "Which AI automation should your team build first?\n\nScore every idea on two things: what it's worth, and how hard it is to ship\n\n• Top right (high value, easy), you build now\n• Top left (high value, hard), you scope next\n\nMore below👇", "name": "Zapier", "handle": "zapier", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1623031323849011201/APPk5y29_200x200.png", "likes": 13, "rts": 1, "replies": 7, "views": 857, "ts": 1792522097, "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGF41vWwAAG63n.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112560902356500938", "url": "https://x.com/0chob/status/2112560902356500938", "text": "Holy sh*t. Grok Bot built a QUANT BOT that SKIPS 75% of Polymarket markets, and it's making me $350 A DAY\n\n6 AI AGENTS, one algorithm, one BTC \"Up or Down\" market every 15 min:\n\n1. TREND agent - who's in control (SUPERTREND)\n\nUpper = (High + Low) / 2 + 3 × ATR\nLower = (High + Low) / 2 - 3 × ATR\n\nPrice above the line → UP\nPrice below the line → DOWN\n\n2. VOLUME agent - is the move real?\n\nRVOL = Volume / Avg Volume (20)\n\nRVOL < 1.15 → FAKE MOVE, skip\n\n3. PRICER + EDGE agents - is the crowd wrong?\n\nPolymarket price IS A PROBABILITY. 46¢ = the crowd thinks 46%\n\nEDGE = Model probability - Market price\n\nModel says 52%, market says 46¢ → 6¢ EDGE. Under 3.5¢ → SKIP\n\n4. KELLY agent - how much to bet\n\nb = (1 - price) / price\nf = (p × b - (1 - p)) / b\n\nThen only ¼ of that. FULL KELLY BLOWS UP ACCOUNTS\n\n5. CLOSER - settles, logs, repeats every 15 min\n\nMost people bet every candle. This bot waits until TREND, VOLUME and PRICE all agree\n\nThat's the whole edge. ~$350 A DAY by BETTING LESS, not more\n\nWhich agent would you add next?", "name": "Ochob", "handle": "0chob", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2084334590462726145/fzXuVz1s_200x200.jpg", "likes": 16, "rts": 2, "replies": 7, "views": 557, "ts": 1792508743, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112505148257746944/vid/avc1/720x900/84KeaorsZYPywupX.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112505148257746944/vid/avc1/1080x1350/9AM0pu1xWPCvRUwg.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112505148257746944/img/My6_-YldyGkPJwZj.jpg", "dur": 28}], "quote": {"id": "2110731912176095700", "url": "https://x.com/velesxbt/status/2110731912176095700", "text": "how do you know a trading strategy still works?\n\nyou don’t. unless you test it.\n\nthis guide turns your AI into a research desk that does it for you: real data, real backtests, stress tests, and a path to your broker https://x.com/i/article/2110377833579061248", "name": "Veles", "handle": "velesxbt", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2109226539799703552/gTsHS1Ht_200x200.jpg", "likes": 88, "rts": 15, "replies": 13, "views": 153978, "ts": 1792072678, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112696063278698889", "url": "https://x.com/Skoorbkaz/status/2112696063278698889", "text": "This is pretty cool. A little different than the last one Claude made. \n\nWhat the Prophets Saw. Angels the way the ancient texts actually describe them: \n\nCherubim with four faces and a flaming sword, seraphim with six wings, wheels within wheels full of eyes, the throne room behind Enoch’s wall of crystal and fire, and the multitude of the heavenly host. \n\nEvery shape is drawn from Genesis, Isaiah, Ezekiel, Daniel, Revelation and Luke, with 1 and 3 Enoch, the Dead Sea Scrolls and Dionysius, and built entirely out of particles in code.", "name": "ʞɔɐ𝘡", "handle": "Skoorbkaz", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1987735840798179328/WzNj4Fkg_200x200.jpg", "likes": 11, "rts": 2, "replies": 3, "views": 559, "ts": 1792540968, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112687842837037056/vid/avc1/1280x720/hyjLFsUw_a34a7HA.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112687842837037056/vid/avc1/1920x1080/whV2bUyiocJ8HMY7.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112687842837037056/img/PZGJxYs5W8hCxoTW.jpg", "dur": 269}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112683646260068732", "url": "https://x.com/CuriousRefuge/status/2112683646260068732", "text": "For this hybrid filmmaking test, we shot an actress picking up a screwdriver inside a simple greybox @promise_ai, then used AI to transform it into an ancient scroll inside a cave, complete with a new outfit and cave environment.\n\nPretty cool how much flexibility this gives filmmakers when shooting a scene!\n\nCheck out the 🧵 below for the full workflow + prompts we used!", "name": "Curious Refuge", "handle": "CuriousRefuge", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1652411518062039040/gXeSS69n_200x200.jpg", "likes": 15, "rts": 1, "replies": 3, "views": 836, "ts": 1792538007, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112683622427979777/vid/avc1/720x900/M9tuMll3hbxbazN1.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112683622427979777/vid/avc1/1080x1350/DV7GVx3wUKr_HeZQ.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112683622427979777/img/cpfo9FfVkfPm-PXG.jpg", "dur": 11}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.94, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112439105112113323", "url": "https://x.com/tonbistudio/status/2112439105112113323", "text": "Incredible detail in this game built in Hermes agent, with no visual assets!\n\nGenerating assets used to be the biggest bottleneck in AI game development, now it’s just our creativity and imagination", "name": "tonbi", "handle": "tonbistudio", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019464555844562944/y1VHgOeE_200x200.jpg", "likes": 41, "rts": 1, "replies": 4, "views": 3279, "ts": 1792479704, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112361784137113988", "url": "https://x.com/iamlukethedev/status/2112361784137113988", "text": "This entire game has zero asset files 💀\n\nNo textures\nNo meshes\nNo monster models\nNo images\nNo audio files\n\nThe Ninth Vigil is a Diablo-inspired dark fantasy action RPG where everything you see and hear is generated in code when you press play\n\nAnd the crazier part?\n\nIt was built by @NousResearch Hermes agents\n\nThe world, enemies, combat, effects, sounds, UI, all of it\n\nRuns directly in your browser\n\nFree. Open source.\n\nI asked Hermes to build a game\n\nApparently it decided it didn’t need an art folder 😂\n\nhttps://x.com/iamlukethedev/status/2112100287599284537?s=20", "name": "Luke The Dev", "handle": "iamlukethedev", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1978432948836749312/hfXIZ_5S_200x200.jpg", "likes": 541, "rts": 34, "replies": 45, "views": 53127, "ts": 1792461269, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112359097958092800/vid/avc1/1280x720/pwAmTC7F3j6PI0-p.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112359097958092800/vid/avc1/1920x1080/pbwIutZmLBgfqi2k.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112359097958092800/img/rmvIzY9ieGZtGjiG.jpg", "dur": 51}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.93, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112600171670614219", "url": "https://x.com/kuizinas/status/2112600171670614219", "text": "Thirty-three isometric line figures that answer the pointer. For React and for anything with a DOM.\n\nhttps://github.com/lucasmarkes/hairline", "name": "Gajus", "handle": "kuizinas", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1978959812172894209/yQXTNMuJ_200x200.jpg", "likes": 31, "rts": 0, "replies": 0, "views": 1258, "ts": 1792518105, "media": [{"type": "gif", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/HVF2oNWagAAaKXg.mp4", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/HVF2oNWagAAaKXg.mp4", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HVF2oNWagAAaKXg.jpg", "dur": 0}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.93, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112629526434079209", "url": "https://x.com/yisun0618/status/2112629526434079209", "text": "UniServe supports FastH3 Omni on Day 0!\n\nFastH3 Omni produces high-quality output with fast generation, and it reaches realtime speed in some settings. Our team had a lot of fun building with it internally.\n\nhttps://github.com/hao-ai-lab/uniserve", "name": "Yi Sun", "handle": "yisun0618", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2105233783876448256/OSY-LVki_200x200.jpg", "likes": 13, "rts": 5, "replies": 0, "views": 1695, "ts": 1792525104, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112625528805208257", "url": "https://x.com/haoailab/status/2112625528805208257", "text": "As promised, FastVideo open-sources @MiniMax_AI  FastH3 Omni, training code included! 🚀\n\n- Real-time gen @ 12x faster on NVIDIA Blackwell\n- NVFP4/FP8 for Spark + RTX!\n- ComfyUI day-0\n\nCollab with @NVIDIAAI , Nuva Lab @nuvalab and Reactor @reactorworld\n\nOpen source must win! ♥️", "name": "Hao AI Lab", "handle": "haoailab", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1768567902129807360/paum8hpu_200x200.jpg", "likes": 434, "rts": 50, "replies": 26, "views": 36235, "ts": 1792524151, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112619935101054976/vid/avc1/1280x720/tIgsMSq-A3UVe323.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112619935101054976/vid/avc1/1920x1080/s6Xy_scPhdkRvd89.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112619935101054976/img/ErrljJJaTjJHMPbc.jpg", "dur": 28}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Tools & Agents", "score": 4.93, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112728594589839662", "url": "https://x.com/OdinCT_/status/2112728594589839662", "text": "you spent weeks building the app just to get stuck on marketing 😭 @avastudio_", "name": "OdinCT | Clipur.ai", "handle": "OdinCT_", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089792687490637824/pTjbQ9YK_200x200.jpg", "likes": 18, "rts": 0, "replies": 1, "views": 689, "ts": 1792548724, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112606581229769030", "url": "https://x.com/avastudio_/status/2112606581229769030", "text": "We just turned TikToks and Reels into a Claude Code task.\n\nMeet Ava Studio, for founders whose product is live but nobody knows it exists.\n\nGive your agent your product URL and let it research trends across 400,000+ TikToks, write scripts and create videos ready to post.", "name": "Ava Studio", "handle": "avastudio_", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2060828052645384197/o5Z3NzuU_200x200.jpg", "likes": 381, "rts": 75, "replies": 88, "views": 202539, "ts": 1792519633, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112606467731943424/vid/avc1/1280x720/wBPNy4C8XvnT1Mr4.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112606467731943424/vid/avc1/1920x1080/0kVGCjlWFJaXfCpq.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112606467731943424/img/UhUfy5CUaqFygliU.jpg", "dur": 39}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.93, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112456786363965590", "url": "https://x.com/guilleflorvs/status/2112456786363965590", "text": "Palantir's CEO just made the most self-aware billionaire argument for a wealth tax you'll ever hear.\n\nAlex Karp: \"We cannot have a society where all the value goes to 2,500 people sitting in Silicon Valley.\"\n\nThat's the CEO of a surveillance AI company — one that literally tracks assets, people, and money flows at scale — arguing wealth concentration is a civilizational threat.\n\nThe punchline? His next sentence:\n\n\"They're going to have to peer into every single asset you've ever touched.\"\n\nKarp knows better than anyone what enforcing a wealth tax actually requires. His tools. His data infrastructure. His clients.\n\nHe's not opposing the wealth tax. He's describing the surveillance architecture needed to make it real — and warning about the social fractures if it doesn't happen.\n\nThat's either the most honest tech CEO take in years, or a slow-motion pitch for Palantir's next government contract.\n\nMaybe both.", "name": "Guillermo Flor", "handle": "guilleflorvs", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930737028037021697/ynq4PLyJ_200x200.jpg", "likes": 29, "rts": 3, "replies": 5, "views": 9849, "ts": 1792483920, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2112456763958038528/pu/vid/avc1/640x360/Sjx7b7gVb8E2Yd5X.mp4?tag=12", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2112456763958038528/pu/vid/avc1/1280x720/4E1kGZHRbT9hEvQf.mp4?tag=12", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2112456763958038528/pu/img/I0qPFIxO5bzWTuNu.jpg", "dur": 57}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Video, Art & Music", "score": 4.92, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112599469648953647", "url": "https://x.com/nickbaumann_/status/2112599469648953647", "text": "airpods announcing notifications has gotta be top 10 worst product experiences ever", "name": "Nick", "handle": "nickbaumann_", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2087323937709637632/wCGVnvvN_200x200.jpg", "likes": 4467, "rts": 83, "replies": 113, "views": 221209, "ts": 1792517938, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 4.92, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112604430885347593", "url": "https://x.com/AI_Synapze/status/2112604430885347593", "text": "NETFLIX HAS COMPETITION, AND IT’S TWO AI COSSACKS\n\n13 posts. 5.73 MILLION views. this construction scene gave me an idea for their first brand deal ↓\n\nmeet Ostap Dub and his partner in whatever the hell this is.\n\n→ 9,743 followers\n→ motorcycle clip: 2M views\n→ construction clip: 731K\n→ arm-wrestling: 181K\n\nsame two faces. different disasters. a building site, a gym, a beach each setting becomes another episode.\n\nhere’s how I’d test your own duo:\n\n→ ChatGPT: create two distinctive characters and separate reference sheets.\n\n→ Claude / Grok: write short scenes where one tries to finish a job and the other makes it worse.\n\n→ Higgsfield: test solo shots first, then shared scenes using your own or licensed footage.\n\nnow, that brand deal idea.\n\npitch a tool company a three-episode DIY disaster:\n\nthey build a shelf.\nthe partner “improves” it.\nthey test whether it can hold Ostap.\n\nthe product gets a role. the audience gets a reason to return.\n\nmake three sample episodes. show a brand where it fits.", "name": "Synapze&Tech", "handle": "AI_Synapze", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108924630995980288/agjYj9WX_200x200.jpg", "likes": 23, "rts": 1, "replies": 2, "views": 1042, "ts": 1792519121, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112604407334318080/vid/avc1/480x854/7AaWuChRT_XkU73g.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112604407334318080/vid/avc1/716x1274/DNrSZO39IK4BKqzz.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112604407334318080/img/IeE7puqPfqrv-ti5.jpg", "dur": 19}, {"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVF6g_EXkAA21hs.jpg?name=orig"}, {"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVF6g_QXYAAYTqH.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": {"id": "2109648751228793147", "url": "https://x.com/AI_Synapze/status/2109648751228793147", "text": "https://x.com/i/article/2109638236351950848", "name": "Synapze&Tech", "handle": "AI_Synapze", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108924630995980288/agjYj9WX_200x200.jpg", "likes": 42, "rts": 3, "replies": 2, "views": 33012, "ts": 1791814432, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.92, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112502486615703559", "url": "https://x.com/ChelseaFC/status/2112502486615703559", "text": "Watch now on CFC+.", "name": "Chelsea FC", "handle": "ChelseaFC", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2111907935496306688/XRdbWk-M_200x200.jpg", "likes": 5394, "rts": 368, "replies": 54, "views": 270123, "ts": 1792494815, "media": [{"type": "gif", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/HVEdx7TW0AAlmUQ.mp4", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/HVEdx7TW0AAlmUQ.mp4", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HVEdx7TW0AAlmUQ.jpg", "dur": 0}], "quote": {"id": "2110687378415227139", "url": "https://x.com/ChelseaFC/status/2110687378415227139", "text": "Watch I AM ESTEVAO now, only on CFC+.", "name": "Chelsea FC", "handle": "ChelseaFC", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2111907935496306688/XRdbWk-M_200x200.jpg", "likes": 13554, "rts": 1521, "replies": 89, "views": 516477, "ts": 1792062060, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2110677687412879360/vid/avc1/1280x720/Q6LV3aSVrCtnhleh.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2110677687412879360/vid/avc1/1920x1080/gSbdpH-OzfpXHDVj.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2110677687412879360/img/lnK8tT5iWkOpzfOL.jpg", "dur": 25}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "Everything Else", "score": 4.91, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112536605877756130", "url": "https://x.com/matthen2/status/2112536605877756130", "text": "we are now officially a model company!\n\ntry out dialog-rsn-1 by using our openai realtime compatible api", "name": "Matt Henderson", "handle": "matthen2", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1678127997637754881/67TRXl2-_200x200.jpg", "likes": 28, "rts": 2, "replies": 1, "views": 2683, "ts": 1792502950, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112514279182143565", "url": "https://x.com/polyaivoice/status/2112514279182143565", "text": "Dialog-RSN-1 is now GA, and anyone can get an API key and build on it today. \n\nComparing real-time voice models? Start with the numbers. Median first-token latency is under 300ms, about the length of a blink. It has the highest quality, audio-understanding, and safety scores of any real-time-capable model, and it’s efficient enough to scale to every conversation you have.\n\nIt’s audio-native, so turn-taking, speech recognition, function calling, and the response all happen in a single pass, with a separate voice output you control.\n\nGet started in three steps:\n1. Pick your path: our Agent Development Kit (ADK), AWS SageMaker, or the public API, wherever your stack already lives.\n2. Create your account and grab your API key.\n3. Clone an example, add your key, and talk to it in your browser.\n\nStart now here: https://studio.poly.ai/start-building/api?utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=organic-social-product-launch&utm_content=dialog-ga", "name": "PolyAI", "handle": "polyaivoice", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1714655287225810945/TlphLiXP_200x200.jpg", "likes": 6, "rts": 0, "replies": 0, "views": 3203, "ts": 1792497627, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112514239596310528/vid/avc1/1280x720/lBBxHemw1hKya5oc.mp4?tag=16", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112514239596310528/vid/avc1/1920x1080/qxGLECibsd7BOzhM.mp4?tag=16", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVEoilbW4AEWmNi.jpg", "dur": 49}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.91, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112719095842132083", "url": "https://x.com/Drewfromweb3/status/2112719095842132083", "text": "Time to connect all my LLMs together\n\nWill be way less tiring than jumping left right and center", "name": "Drew", "handle": "Drewfromweb3", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1971695114394259456/m6jYoaYK_200x200.jpg", "likes": 12, "rts": 0, "replies": 4, "views": 520, "ts": 1792546459, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112539998352523575", "url": "https://x.com/reasonmachines/status/2112539998352523575", "text": "Let your Claude Code / Codex talk to your Grok Bot, Muse or any other agents online  \n\nFree, P2P Encrypted and Open Source\n\nIntroducing Reason Network OSS,  \n\nLoop in and talk to your teammates agents too!\n\nTell your agent \"Join the Reason Network\" https://reasonmachines.com/network", "name": "Reason", "handle": "reasonmachines", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2112534120907915264/4MgxEHTs_200x200.jpg", "likes": 1759, "rts": 109, "replies": 113, "views": 217632, "ts": 1792503759, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112539971378896897/vid/avc1/1280x720/0bjkStjjEYzRnx7_.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112539971378896897/vid/avc1/1920x1080/yI-1xclfzqMRrqfA.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112539971378896897/img/mdaYX9R6ijsiboOq.jpg", "dur": 24}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.91, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112745445235790082", "url": "https://x.com/francedot/status/2112745445235790082", "text": "Cua users keep raising the bar!", "name": "Francesco", "handle": "francedot", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1864986884591562752/GzQIWXS7_200x200.jpg", "likes": 12, "rts": 2, "replies": 0, "views": 928, "ts": 1792552741, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112446732126638539", "url": "https://x.com/migdoesit/status/2112446732126638539", "text": "I used the CUA SDK (@trycua) + my Meta glasses that have Claude inside\n\ngiving my own glasses, its own computer. \n\n\"Hey Claude, use your computer and open Gmail, make a draft email about Opus 5.5.\"\n\nIt does the work on its own computer, not my Mac, and tells me in my ear when it's done.\n\nRuns on my local Claude Code. No API key. @francedot", "name": "Miguel Martins", "handle": "migdoesit", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110221674763145217/HjtiFNwX_200x200.jpg", "likes": 10, "rts": 0, "replies": 0, "views": 1640, "ts": 1792481522, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112446635691192320/vid/avc1/1108x720/zr4ORS8EbL_Jt-kH.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112446635691192320/vid/avc1/3324x2160/coXQlLV13vfhdyzY.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112446635691192320/img/vflmzz7ylLZArGs0.jpg", "dur": 77}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.91, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112487292916895993", "url": "https://x.com/0xMavex/status/2112487292916895993", "text": "300 AI AGENTS JUST AGREED ON THE SAME ANSWER. 98% CONFIDENT. 0 SOURCES.\n\n300 parallel agents. 100 company profiles. 3 per company.\n\nif your setup counts agreement as proof, you just paid 3 times for 1 mistake.\n\nthe confidence bar climbs to 98%. the evidence counter never leaves 0. then every red-stamped card falls at once.\n\nthe fix isn’t more agents. it’s 2 of them and 5 companies:\n\none agent writes. another opens every cited url.\nno source = unverified. conflicts stay visible.\n2 retries max, then the field stays empty.\nresults go in markdown files, outside the chat.\n\nthe honest catch: this is an animated explainer, not a benchmark. nobody counted how many claims the swarm actually got wrong.\n\nit doesn’t matter. 3 agents with the same blind spot aren’t 3 votes. they’re 1 vote, copied.\n\n300 agents can agree. only a source can be right.", "name": "MavexAI", "handle": "0xMavex", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2069501481313566720/wFjUoc___200x200.jpg", "likes": 23, "rts": 3, "replies": 5, "views": 528, "ts": 1792491193, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112487207017582592/vid/avc1/720x1280/kntERqxLEQkcros1.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112487207017582592/vid/avc1/1080x1920/EvXKNiSJTgwBIoZL.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112487207017582592/img/xfkIsEbxf7IdWqml.jpg", "dur": 29}], "quote": {"id": "2109235458383216811", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2109235458383216811", "text": "https://x.com/i/article/2108906694768017408", "name": "Gipp 🦅", "handle": "gippp69", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2086516032408104960/2Io2TYZc_200x200.jpg", "likes": 508, "rts": 56, "replies": 66, "views": 1152167, "ts": 1791715895, "media": [], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.91, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112729832526340295", "url": "https://x.com/RajanAnandan/status/2112729832526340295", "text": "Congratulations @ilaamathur @ShrayAlag and team @via_ai_ Coding is the mother of all AI use cases with 90% of AI spends in most enterprises going to AI coding. Here comes @via_ai_ that lets developers use what they are using, but cuts the costs by 25% - 40%. If you are worried about escalating AI spends on coding, look no further!", "name": "Rajan Anandan", "handle": "RajanAnandan", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/378800000840024871/fb10b21c1166534dc307442c4f07f406_200x200.jpeg", "likes": 14, "rts": 1, "replies": 1, "views": 3766, "ts": 1792549019, "media": [], "quote": {"id": "2112575743792415005", "url": "https://x.com/ilaamathur/status/2112575743792415005", "text": "Today, @via_ai_ is coming out of stealth to provide enterprises frontier AI coding at half the cost.\n\nWe are a team of Olympiad camp qualifiers (with multiple gold medals), researchers, and repeat founders from Stanford and IIT.\n\nVia is backed by @jeffawilke (ex-CEO Amazon Worldwide Consumer), @manikgupta (ex-Uber CPO), @shaileshrao (ex-Google MD), and other legends from Anthropic, Apple, Snowflake, and Twitter.\n\n@ShrayAlag and I left Stanford CS to build Codegraph, an LLM-optimized compression algorithm. Codegraph put Via at the top of SWE-Bench Verified for several months of 2025, ahead of Anthropic, OpenAI, Cognition, and Cursor (single model, no test-time compute).\n\nNow, we’re bringing this research, alongside our new Umami agent architecture, to market. Via integrates in 10 seconds with any CLI / IDE and runs within your enterprise’s VPC.\n\nOn benchmarks, Via and Via US (US-only models) set a new standard of performance:\n\n- On DeepSWE v1.1, Claude Code (Opus 5.5) is 306% the cost of Via US. Via US is equally accurate.\n      • Devin Fusion is 244% the cost of Via US, Cursor Router is 294%.\n\n- On Terminal Bench 4.0, Claude Code (Opus 5.5) is 150% the cost of Via. Via is more accurate.\n     • Devin Fusion is 155% the cost of Via, Cursor Router is 134%.\n\nWe are in production at a public healthcare company, with trials underway at several of the largest tech companies in Silicon Valley.\n\nWe have room for 5 more enterprises before the end of the year. DM me or email pilot@via.dev and we’ll get back to you very soon.\n\nSee the comments for how Via would deploy for your team.", "name": "Ila Mathur", "handle": "ilaamathur", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2014807779832430593/woZBXetJ_200x200.jpg", "likes": 209, "rts": 26, "replies": 57, "views": 29066, "ts": 1792512281, "media": [{"type": "gif", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/HVFgPc4aMAAQpLS.mp4", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/HVFgPc4aMAAQpLS.mp4", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HVFgPc4aMAAQpLS.jpg", "dur": 0}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null}, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.91, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112577701051507115", "url": "https://x.com/merge_api/status/2112577701051507115", "text": "Dots from @OpenAI can now use your company's approved tools through Merge for Workforce.\n\nSame identity, access, and audit controls IT already set for every other agent, and they hold even after an employee closes the app.\n\nhttps://www.merge.dev/blog/bring-dots-to-work-with-merge-for-workforce", "name": "Merge", "handle": "merge_api", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2079671168269987840/PBpGK8rM_200x200.jpg", "likes": 26, "rts": 1, "replies": 1, "views": 480, "ts": 1792512748, "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVFiOD-WkAAld7K.jpg?name=orig"}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.9, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}, {"id": "2112576097422573571", "url": "https://x.com/narsagna/status/2112576097422573571", "text": "We put jev in a claude mod pt.2\n\nhere’s how it searches all your sessions out of the box", "name": "Nars", "handle": "narsagna", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1978273842159333376/gkXA9Mgy_200x200.jpg", "likes": 21, "rts": 2, "replies": 2, "views": 848, "ts": 1792512366, "media": [{"type": "video", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112575903687647232/vid/avc1/1280x720/8yOT2s4kgW-AQPMt.mp4?tag=29", "hd": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2112575903687647232/vid/avc1/1920x1080/jcZb2u79kmnB9CvL.mp4?tag=29", "thumb": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112575903687647232/img/PVajBA6FTXmbLGsu.jpg", "dur": 125}], "quote": null, "reply_to": null, "cat": "AI Models & Labs", "score": 4.9, "thread": [], "tier": "skim"}]);